  "body_html": "<h1>minimax</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ntheorem minimax (A : I → J → 𝕜) : ∃ (x : I → 𝕜) (y : J → 𝕜) (v : 𝕜), (∀ i, 0 ≤ x i) ∧ (∑ i, x i = 1) ∧ (∀ j, 0 ≤ y j) ∧ (∑ j, y j = 1) ∧ (∀ j, v ≤ ∑ i, x i * A i j) ∧ (∀ i, ∑ j, A i j * y j ≤ v)</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>minimax_pos</li>\n</ul>",
